 <h3><u>Neza sawaar bhai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya hussain..(6)<br> Ek shor hai bazaar mein,<br> Ya hussain, ya hussain, ya hussain</p> 
  <p>Guzra damishq se, jab kaarwaan e azaa<br> oonto'n pe thi bibiyaa'n, koofe ki shehzadiyaa'n<br> naizo'n pe the sab (shaheedo'n ke sar)..(2)<br> bhai pe pohchi behen ki nazar<br> kehne lagi wo behen nauhagar<br> mai dekhti rahi hun teri jung e karbala<br> hussain ya hussain<br> mai dekhti rahi hun teri jung e karbala<br> ab mera marhala..(2)<br> aankhei'n na band kar</p> 
  <p>Naiza sawaar bhai, aise quraan padh..(2)<br> koi na dekh paaye..(2), mujhko barahna sar</p> 
  <p>1. Barsaat pattharo'n ki, sar nange bibiyaa'n..(2)<br> itna kathan hai bhai..(2), saadat ka safar</p> 
  <p>2. Teri yaad mein hai roti, sakina bazaar mein..(2)<br> behlaye usko kaise..(2), jaaye behan kidhar</p> 
  <p>3. Chadar ki hai sawali, zahra ki betiyaa'n..(2)<br> hota nahi kisi par..(2), faryaad ka asar</p> 
  <p>4. Baalo'n se mu'n chhupau, ya khaak udhaau mai..(2)<br> laa de kahin se chadar..(2), ya ek kaam kar</p> 
  <p>5. Sab dekhte usi ko, hota agar yahaa'n..(2)<br> deta azaan aisi..(2), akbar mera pisar</p> 
  <p>Allahu akbar..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Zehmat na tujhko deti, majboor hai behan..(2)<br> ae bhai har shaqi ki..(2), naa paak hai nazar</p> 
  <p>Naiza sawaar bhai, aise quraan padh..(2)<br> Aise quraan padh..(4)</p> 
